    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knight of Noshland</strong> is a hack-and-slash tower defense game set in a vibrant 3D world. You play as a Crusader Knight, directly shaping the flow of the battlefield. Fight head-on through relentless hordes, luring and slowing enemy forces to maximize the devastating power of your towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your primary defense is an arsenal of buildable and upgradeable towers. Starting with a base set of 8, there are 20 unique tower types, including upgrades, side-grades, and complete transformations, with a few rare variants hidden for players to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But towers are only part of your strategy. Take the fight into your own hands as you charge into waves of enemies, carving through hordes in third-person combat. You can enchant armor and forge elemental swords to fully stack the odds in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noshland itself is a surreal realm, a fertile land of ginormous edibles, poisoned by growing dark forces. Across this fantastical world, you\u2019ll face 20 enemy types each with unique abilities that force you to quickly adapt, including 3 colossal boss encounters. And keep an eye out\u2026 you may stumble across rare secret enemy variants, ready to turn the tide in unexpected ways.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275130/extras/85231afb95daa3596dd692ca2c2b21d1.webp?t=1754771183\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275130/extras/56e822c7311ff6ba0108e60d8ef6bf85.poster.avif?t=1754771183\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s